    "body": "Closes #40159\r\n\r\n### Problem\r\nCurrently, there is no ergonomic way to pass arguments to arbitrary Vimscript code that doesn't involve building a string like there is for Lua with `nvim_exec_lua()`.\r\n\r\n### Solution\r\nExtend `nvim_exec2()` to accept a list of arguments and possibly returns values using new special global variables `v:args` and `v:result`.\r\n\r\nNeeds #33392 ",
